00:00:50.789 --> 00:00:57.329
to select split so that is the effect

00:00:54.719 --> 00:00:59.550
that will be applied to that slate you

00:00:57.329 --> 00:01:01.920
can select different transitions for

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:03.449
different slides but if you are

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:05.840
presenting this to a professional

00:01:03.449 --> 00:01:08.549
audience I would recommend maintaining

00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:10.350
consistency within the slide so the

00:01:08.549 --> 00:01:12.479
transition should be the same and there

00:01:10.350 --> 00:01:14.909
is an easy way of doing ups or a selects

00:01:12.479 --> 00:01:17.100
later on again I know that split has

00:01:14.909 --> 00:01:19.350
